        "There are {count} Updates": "Hay {count} actualizaciones",
        "Vesktop & Endcord": "Vesktop y Endcord",
        "Vesktop and Endcord are two separate things. This updater is for Endcord.": "Vesktop y Endcord son cosas distintas. Este actualizador es para Endcord.",
